WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:11,230
Xuewu was injured

2
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:13,430
Can Xuebao find some healing herbs?

3
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:17,390
The smell of blood will attract other beasts

4
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:43,420
Take it away first and eat it later.

5
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:48,270
What about the medicine that Xue Bao found for you?

6
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,470
I know I’m wrong and I’m embarrassed to eat it.

7
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,480
Do you know why I'm angry?

8
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,080
One is because you are disobedient

9
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,680
The second reason is because you underestimate your opponent.

10
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,080
Not taking combat seriously

11
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:00,680
He was seriously injured

12
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:01,680
There is a third point

13
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,680
They just have no basic respect for their prey.

14
00:01:04,430 --> 00:01:05,830
The jungle of the world

15
00:01:05,830 --> 00:01:07,830
People can kill animals, animals can eat people

16
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:09,830
But we are all part of Wanling Continent

17
00:01:09,830 --> 00:01:12,030
We hunt spiritual beasts to obtain materials

18
00:01:12,030 --> 00:01:13,630
thank them for their efforts

19
00:01:13,630 --> 00:01:15,030
Shouldn't kill them anymore

20
00:01:15,030 --> 00:01:16,830
Treat them as your own bragging rights
